(Sentence 2: "The biotechnology facility has maintained ISO-9001 compliance [since / for]) Tj
T*
(its inception in March 2015.") Tj
T*
(- Solution: SINCE. \('March 2015' marks a specific starting point in time\).) Tj
T*
(Sentence 3: "The fermentation broth has been incubating [since / for] 08:00 AM this) Tj
T*
(morning.") Tj
T*
(- Solution: SINCE. \('08:00 AM' is a defined calendar point of origin\).) Tj
T*
(Sentence 4: "The patient has experienced therapeutic remission [since / for] twelve) Tj
T*
(consecutive months.") Tj
T*
(- Solution: FOR. \('twelve consecutive months' is a measured temporal span\).) Tj
T*
